// PYTHON_DIGIT_BITMAP_HASH and PYTHON_DECIMAL_BITMAP_HASH are FNV-1a
// 64 over the bitmap of each range table: every code point 0x0..0x10ffff
// in order, the predicate's bit packed into a byte most-significant
// first.  The Odin suite recomputes them through the compiled predicates
// (tests/cli_test.odin:test_python_digits_match_the_generated_bitmaps),
// so the tables and `python_is_digit`/`python_int` are checked against
// the reference's database for every code point and not only for the
// ones a scenario names.
